      "dcterms:title": "Discrete Heisenberg–Weyl group and modular group",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "Faddeev, L. D."
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20241126",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9504111",
      "dcterms:abstract": "It is shown that the generators of two discrete Heisenberg-Weyl groups with irra- tional rotation numbers θ and −1/θ generate the whole algebra B of bounded operators on L2(R). The natural action of the modular group in B is implied. Applications to dynamical algebras appearing in lattice regularization and some duality principles are discussed.",
